<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#2C2A26">We tried to charge your saved card for invoice INV-2026-00007, but the payment was not completed. Nothing was taken from your card, and the invoice is still open.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="margin:0 0 20px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DDD6CA;font-size:14px;color:#57524A">Invoice</td><td align="right" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DDD6CA;font-size:14px;color:#141412;font-weight:600">INV-2026-00007</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DDD6CA;font-size:14px;color:#57524A">Amount due</td><td align="right" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DDD6CA;font-size:14px;color:#141412;font-weight:600">$25.00</td></tr></table>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:8px 0 24px"><tr><td style="background:#1E7A52;border-radius:6px"><a href="https://example.com/pay/abc" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 22px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none">Pay invoice</a></td></tr></table>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#57524A">You can pay with another card, a mobile wallet or a bank transfer. If your card has expired, remove it in the client portal and save a new one.</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:20px 32px;border-top:1px solid #DDD6CA;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#57524A">Kuzikode Intelligent Technologies<br><a href="https://kuzikode.example/" style="color:#57524A">kuzikode.example</a></td></tr>
</table></td></tr></table></body></html>"
`;

